&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Examples using this formula&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Graeme McLaren  collection - license Creative Commons  (CC-BY 4.0)/amazingIFS hex.fract&lt;br&gt;Graeme McLaren  collection - license Creative Commons  (CC-BY 4.0)/amazingIFS hexprsm2.fract&lt;br&gt;Graeme McLaren  collection - license Creative Commons  (CC-BY 4.0)/amazingIFS hexprsm2_a.fract&lt;br&gt;Krzysztof Marczak collection - license Creative Commons (CC-BY 4.0)/hex prism and chromatic.fract&lt;h3&gt;Code&lt;/h3&gt;</string>
